0 // Source: 10 pages; 48 placements and 9 actual construction steps. Page10 is the final view.
0 // P5 input: axle Z-20, yellow40T gears Z+/-94 and outward crank Z-134; finite gear/crank insertion40/26/26 LDU.
0 // P6 red24T gears: Z+/-100, shared7.5deg phase,40LDU axle coverage. Red angle a gives yellow angle-0.6a.
0 // P7 crown/axle/crank phases: negativeZ -8.75deg, positiveZ +23.75deg. Each crown has40LDU axle coverage; each crank main bore20LDU.
0 // P7 wing roots retain source-posed -15/+30deg attitude; exact coaxial inward eccentric pins insert40LDU into80LDU hole envelopes. These are free round-pin joints.
0 // P9 eight plates use exact orthonormal root-local stud positions. P8 head seats on two rear beak studs; two front studs remain exposed.
0 // Four gear pairs: red0..360deg/.25deg sampled clear; bilateral tooth stops checked every.5deg. Negative crown angle+a, positive crown-a.
0 // Prescribed reciprocal display: input-20..+20deg/.25deg,161 poses;15 finite interfaces and cross-group clearance checked at every pose.
0 // Display path imposes each wing/crank relative angle; a single free round pin does not enforce it automatically. No unlimited whole-model rotation or physical-force claim.
0 // Source-visible topology preserved. Hidden depths and exact phases are geometry-based inferences. No native part geometry changed.
